#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:48
msgid ""
"In charge of the tech transition of several stacks from <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">.NET</span> to <span class=\"txt-bold\">Node.js</span> to help reduce "
"infrastructure costs while improving the performance and scalability of the "
"stacks. Deployed the stacks to <span class=\"txt-bold\">AWS Lambda</span>, "
"<span class=\"txt-bold\">ECS</span>, and <span class=\"txt-bold\">EKS</span> "
"services using <span class=\"txt-bold\">Terraform</span> and <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Harness</span>."
msgstr ""
"Responsable de la migration de plusieurs services de <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">.NET</span> à <span class=\"txt-bold\">Node.js</span> pour aider "
"réduir les coûts d'infrastructure et favoriser l'évolutivité, la flexibilité "
"et la performance des services. Ces services sont déployés dans <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">AWS Lambda</span>, <span class=\"txt-bold\">ECS</span>, "
"and <span class=\"txt-bold\">EKS</span> en utilisant <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Terraform</span> et <span class=\"txt-bold\">Harness</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:57
msgid ""
"Contributed to the development of several web components made with <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Vanilla JavaScript</span>. The web components helped "
"standardize the UI/UX throughout the website of one of Altimetrik's clients."
msgstr ""
"J'ai contribué à développer plusieurs Web Components avec <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Vanilla JavaScript</span>. Ces Web Components aide standardiser le UI/"
"UX du site internet de l'un des clients d'Altimetrik."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:61
msgid ""
"Led the development team to successfuly achieve the technical goals of the "
"company."
msgstr ""
"Responsable Technique de l'équipe de développeurs de la start-up avec "
"l'objectif de mener à bien les buts techniques."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:63
msgid ""
"Developed a chatbot for converting leads into customers through social "
"channels like Facebook Messenger and WhatsApp. The chatbot helped increase "
"leads conversion by 26%. It was developed using <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Node.js</span>, <span class=\"txt-bold\">MySQL</span>, <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">PostgreSQL</span> and <span class=\"txt-bold\">MongoDB</"
"span>."
msgstr ""
"Développement du chatbot utilisé par la start-up pour transformer les "
"clients potentiels en ventes par des moyens de communication sociales comme "
"Facebook Messenger et WhatsApp. Le chatbot a aidé augmenter de 26% la "
"conversion de clients. Usage de <span class=\"txt-bold\">Node.js</span>, "
"<span class=\"txt-bold\">MySQL</span>, <span class=\"txt-bold\">PostgreSQL</"
"span> et <span class=\"txt-bold\">MongoDB</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:70
msgid ""
"Contributed to the development of the company's CRM using <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Node.js</span>, <span class=\"txt-bold\">AWS Lambda</span>, <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">MySQL</span>, <span class=\"txt-bold\">PostgreSQL</span> "
"and <span class=\"txt-bold\">React</span>."
msgstr ""
"J'ai contribué à développer le CRM de la start-up en utilisant <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Node.js</span>, <span class=\"txt-bold\">AWS Lambda</"
"span>, <span class=\"txt-bold\">MySQL</span>, <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">PostgreSQL</span> et <span class=\"txt-bold\">React</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:75
msgid ""
"Developed microservices using <span class=\"txt-bold\">Node.js</span> and "
"<span class=\"txt-bold\">GraphQL</span> and deployed them to <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">AWS Lambda</span>."
msgstr ""
"J'ai développé des microservices avec <span class=\"txt-bold\">Node.js</"
"span> et <span class=\"txt-bold\">GraphQL</span> et je les ai déployé dans "
"<span class=\"txt-bold\">AWS Lambda</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:78
msgid ""
"Implemented a <span class=\"txt-bold\">Headless CMS (Webiny)</span> to "
"dynamically serve localized content for a website, improving loading times "
"by nearly 30%."
msgstr ""
"J'ai implémenté un <span class=\"txt-bold\">Headless CMS (Webiny)</span> "
"pour servir dynamiquement du contenu localisé pour une application web. Cela "
"a contribué à diminuer d'environ 30% les temps de chargement."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:81
msgid ""
"Built web applications using a client-server architecture with <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Angular</span> in the front end and <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Lumen (PHP)</span> in the back end. Developed backend services with "
"an MVC architecture using <span class=\"txt-bold\">Laravel (PHP)</span> "
"connected to <span class=\"txt-bold\">MySQL</span> and <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">PostgreSQL</span> databases."
msgstr ""
"J'ai développé des systèmes et applications web avec une architecture client-"
"serveur avec <span class=\"txt-bold\">Angular</span> dans le front end et "
"<span class=\"txt-bold\">Lumen (PHP)</span> dans le back end de même q'une "
"architecture MVC avec <span class=\"txt-bold\">Laravel (PHP)</span>. Usage "
"de <span class=\"txt-bold\">MySQL</span> et <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">PostgreSQL</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:88
msgid ""
"Developed a backend management system for a Government department using "
"<span class=\"txt-bold\">Django (Python)</span> and <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">PostgreSQL</span> to help increase productivity by automating several "
"processes of the department."
msgstr ""
"J'ai développé un système back end pour un organisme gouvernemental avec "
"<span class=\"txt-bold\">Django (Python)</span> et <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">PostgreSQL</span> lequel a augmenté la productivité en automatisant "
"plusieurs processus de l'organisme."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:93
msgid ""
"Collaborated on building a mobile app for a social program using the <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Ionic</span> framework."
msgstr ""
"J'ai collaboré dans le développement d'une application mobile avec le "
"framework <span class=\"txt-bold\">Ionic</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:95
msgid ""
"Worked on the REST APIs that constituted the booking engine of the airline "
"using <span class=\"txt-bold\">C#</span>, <span class=\"txt-bold\">ASP.NET "
"MVC</span> and <span class=\"txt-bold\">ASP.NET Core</span>."
msgstr ""
"J'ai contribué à développer les APIs et services web que font partie du "
"moteur de réservation de la compagnie aérienne avec <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">C#</span>, <span class=\"txt-bold\">ASP.NET MVC</span> et <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">ASP.NET Core</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:99
msgid ""
"In charge of the integration of the airline's booking engine with some of "
"the major booking brokers like Expedia, SkyScanner, and Despegar, resulting "
"in a considerable boost on the airline's sales."
msgstr ""
"Responsable de la connexion du moteur de réservation de la compagnie "
"aérienne avec des brokers de réservations parmis les plus grands: Expedia, "
"SkyScanner, et Despegar. Cela a augmenté les vents considérablement."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:103
msgid ""
"Collaborated on configuring and managing virtual servers and cloud services "
"on <span class=\"txt-bold\">Azure</span>."
msgstr ""
"J'ai contribué à la configuration et la gestion de serveurs et services en "
"nuage <span class=\"txt-bold\">Azure</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:105
msgid ""
"Designed, architected, and developed a MOOC platform based on Open edX. It "
"was built with <span class=\"txt-bold\">Django (Python)</span> and <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Flask (Python)</span> and deployed on a private server "
"with <span class=\"txt-bold\">Debian</span> and <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Nginx</span>."
msgstr ""
"J'ai développé une plate-forme MOOC basé sur Open edX avec <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Django (Python)</span> et <span class=\"txt-bold\">Flask (Python)</"
"span>. Cette plate-forme a été déployée dans un serveur <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Debian</span> privé avec <span class=\"txt-bold\">Nginx</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:111
msgid ""
"Led the development of CARES, a healthcare project that won the first place "
"on the international contest FI-WARE Smart Society (october 2014) and was "
"amongst the finalists of the internatinoal contest FI-WARE Smart Cities "
"(january 2014)."
msgstr ""
"Responsable Technique de l'équipe qui a développé CARES, un projet pour la "
"santé, lequel a gagné la première place au concours international FI-WARE "
"Smart Society (octobre 2014) et qui a été finaliste au concours FI-WARE "
"Smart Cities (janvier 2014)."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:115
msgid ""
"Developed web services with <span class=\"txt-bold\">Tornado (Python)</span>."
msgstr ""
"J'ai développé des services web avec <span class=\"txt-bold\">Tornado "
"(Python)</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:117
msgid ""
"Built productivity apps for iOS and Android using <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Objective-C</span> and <span class=\"txt-bold\">Java</span>."
msgstr ""
"J'ai développé des applications de productivité avec <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Objective-C</span> et <span class=\"txt-bold\">Java</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:120
msgid ""
"Collaborated on the development of videogames for iOS using <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Objective-C</span> and <span class=\"txt-bold\">Cocos 2D</"
"span>."
msgstr ""
"J'ai collaboré dans le développement de jeux video pour iOS en utilisant "
"<span class=\"txt-bold\">Objective-C</span> et <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Cocos 2D</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:123
msgid "In charge of the computerization of the institution."
msgstr "Responsable du projet d'informatisation de l'institution."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:124
msgid ""
"Built a desktop application to help manage the library of the institution "
"with <span class=\"txt-bold\">.NET (C#)</span> and <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">MySQL</span>."
msgstr ""
"J'ai développé un logiciel pour la gestion de la bibliothèque de "
"l'institution avec <span class=\"txt-bold\">.NET (C#)</span> et <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">MySQL</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:127
msgid ""
"Contributed to the development of a desktop application to monitor "
"UDGLive@edu accounts using <span class=\"txt-bold\">.NET (C#)</span> and "
"<span class=\"txt-bold\">Oracle</span>."
msgstr ""
"J'ai contribué à développer un logiciel pour superviser les comptes du "
"courier électronique UDGLive@edu avec <span class=\"txt-bold\">.NET (C#)</"
"span> et <span class=\"txt-bold\">Oracle</span>."

